30
00:31:45,923 --> 00:31:48,523
推しの曲、めっちゃいいよね！
Your oshi's song is super good, right!

31
00:31:49,323 --> 00:31:51,923
みるハコでチャージ！
Charge up with Miruhako!

32
00:31:52,273 --> 00:31:54,923
みるハコなら、臨場感たっぷりで推しのコンテンツが楽しめる！
With Miruhako, you can enjoy your oshi's content with full realism and volume!

33
00:31:55,223 --> 00:31:59,123
推し活も増やそう、みるハコ！
Let's increase your oshi activities with Miruhako!

34
01:03:03,331 --> 01:03:08,581
そうさ ずっと僕らの奇跡が
That's right, so that our miracle will always...

35
01:03:09,131 --> 01:03:12,681
途切れないように歌うんだ もっと高く 大きな声で
Singing so it never fades, higher and with a louder voice!

36
01:03:31,281 --> 01:03:37,631
聞こえてた？何かが始まるサイン 集まって気付けば 和音を奏でた
Could you hear it? A sign that something is starting. When we gathered and noticed, we played harmony.

37
01:03:38,231 --> 01:03:42,731
夢に見るだけじゃ もう足りないでしょ？
Just dreaming isn't enough anymore, right?

38
01:03:43,231 --> 01:03:47,731
キミを待ってる世界があるよ
There is a world waiting for you!

39
01:03:48,231 --> 01:03:53,031
楽しい予感に ほら 飛び乗っちゃえばいい
Come on, just jump onto this joyful premonition!

40
01:03:53,331 --> 01:04:02,431
トキメキは止められないから 走ろう
Because our excitement can't be stopped, let's run!

41
01:04:03,281 --> 01:04:09,631
連れていくよ 光の真ん中 夢の先へ
I'll take you to the center of the light, beyond our dreams!

42
01:04:10,231 --> 01:04:15,731
羽ばたける勇気は キミの願い
The courage to spread your wings is your wish.

43
01:04:16,231 --> 01:04:23,731
みんなでつないだこの奇跡が 途切れないように歌うんだ もっと
Singing on so this miracle we connected together won't fade, even...

44
01:04:24,281 --> 01:04:31,731
高く 大きな声で
...higher, with a louder voice!

45
01:04:42,631 --> 01:04:52,431
答えとか 理屈に惑わされて 彷徨っても 戻ってこれる場所があったんだ
Even if we get lost, confused by answers and logic, there was a place we could always return to.

46
01:04:53,031 --> 01:04:59,731
地図にない道行く 僕らの旅
Our journey traveling down roads not found on any map.

47
01:07:46,681 --> 01:07:52,261
ゆっくり走れ！走れ！道に迷った時がチャンスだ
Run slowly, slowly! When you lose your way, that's your chance!

48
01:07:53,881 --> 01:07:57,931
みんな！今日は見に来てくれて、ありがとうー！
Everyone! Thank you so much for coming to see me today!

49
01:08:01,391 --> 01:08:05,381
目の前のことにがむしゃらで 間違いは数え切れなくて
So driven by what's right in front of me, with countless mistakes made,

50
01:08:06,371 --> 01:08:09,891
一つのことに手一杯で ただ前しか見えてなくて
Putting everything into a single thing, only seeing straight ahead,

51
01:08:13,061 --> 01:08:15,811
「まっすぐ進もう」 キラキラした言葉の持つ
“Move straight ahead” — holding onto glittering words,

52
01:08:17,851 --> 01:08:20,721
「止まらずに行こう」 力に押されそうだ
“Let’s keep going without stopping” — feeling pressured by that strength.

53
01:08:22,121 --> 01:08:25,871
忘れたくないよ ただ『好き』の気持ち
I don't want to forget just this feeling of "love."

54
01:08:31,421 --> 01:08:34,731
他人の興味ばかりを 気にするのはやめよう
Let's stop worrying only about what others find interesting.

55
01:08:34,731 --> 01:08:38,091
ゆっくり走れ！走れ！道に迷った時がチャンスだ
Run slowly, slowly! When you lose your way, that's your chance!

56
01:08:39,271 --> 01:08:42,781
『何にもない』もない 新しい僕が見つかるはずさ
Even "having nothing" is nothing — I'm sure I'll find a new me.

57
01:08:45,371 --> 01:08:49,511
出来ないことばっかり見えて くるくるいつも遠回り
Seeing nothing but what I can't do, spinning around in circles taking the long way round,

58
01:08:50,351 --> 01:08:55,981
だけど昨日よりは道が見える なら大丈夫
But if I can see the path better than yesterday, then it'll be alright.

59
01:09:05,391 --> 01:09:09,801
踏み出してしまった道は なかなか戻りづらくなって
The path once stepped onto is hard to turn back from,

60
01:09:10,791 --> 01:09:15,391
これも一つの経験だ たった一人の人生だ
This too is a single experience, in a life lived all on my own.

61
01:09:21,851 --> 01:09:25,861
臆病な僕をみんなは責めなかった
Everyone didn't blame my timid self.

62
01:09:27,551 --> 01:09:31,301
忘れたくないよ この『僕』の気持ち
I don't want to forget this feeling of "me."

63
01:09:32,271 --> 01:09:36,701
『誰か』を演じてた 嘘はもうやめよう
I'll stop lying by playing the role of "someone else."

64
01:09:37,681 --> 01:09:42,101
ゆっくり走れ！走れ！風が吹いたら進む証明だ
Run slowly, slowly! If the wind blows, it's proof to keep moving forward.

65
01:09:47,661 --> 01:09:51,801
出来ないことばっかり見えて くるくるいつも遠回り
Seeing nothing but what I can't do, spinning around in circles taking the long way round,

66
01:09:52,701 --> 01:09:55,971
だけど昨日よりは道が見える なら大丈夫
But if I can see the path better than yesterday, then it'll be alright.

67
01:10:01,631 --> 01:10:05,031
今年で5回目の出演となります！
This marks my 5th time performing here!

68
01:10:05,580 --> 01:10:07,420
また会いに来てくれて
Thank you for coming to see me again...

69
01:10:07,420 --> 01:10:09,840
みんなの応援が聞こえてとっても嬉しいです
I can hear everyone's cheers and I'm so happy.

70
01:10:09,840 --> 01:10:13,640
私もみんなの気持ちに応えられるように頑張るから
I'll do my best to live up to everyone's feelings,

71
01:10:13,640 --> 01:10:21,080
最後まで最高のフェスになるようにみんなも盛り上がってほしいな！
so I hope everyone will get hyped so this can be the ultimate festival until the very end!

72
01:10:27,684 --> 01:10:32,744
ゆっくり足で腕で身体を使って 前に進もう
Run slowly, use your feet, arms, and body, let's move forward!

73
01:10:32,964 --> 01:10:35,304
ゆっくり走れ！走れ！ 道に迷った時がチャンスだ
Run slowly, run! When you lose your way, that's your chance!

74
01:10:35,504 --> 01:10:41,064
「何にもない」もない 新しい僕が見つかるはずさ
There's nothing, not even "nothing"—I'm bound to find a new me.

75
01:10:41,264 --> 01:10:48,964
出来ないことばっかり見えて くるくるいつも遠回り
Seeing only what I can't do, spinning around in circles taking detours...

76
01:10:48,964 --> 01:10:54,264
だけど昨日よりは明日が見えるから大丈夫
...but I can see tomorrow better than yesterday, so it'll be fine!

77
01:11:37,657 --> 01:11:41,757
女神！ 聖女！ 叡智！ 聡明！ 慈愛！ 博愛！
Goddess! Saint! Wisdom! Brilliance! Mercy! Universal love!

78
01:11:41,757 --> 01:11:48,257
あたし なんてったってお姫様 この人生におけるヒロイン
I am, when all is said and done, a princess—the heroine of this life!

79
01:11:48,257 --> 01:11:52,257
ですわー！
That's right—desuwa!

80
01:11:54,257 --> 01:12:00,257
一生 姫プでイージーモード！ って思ったら勝手にどうぞ？！ 世間はいつも風向き次第
Living the princess life on easy mode all my life! If you think that, go ahead?! The world is always at the mercy of the wind.

81
01:12:00,257 --> 01:12:03,257
有象無象ばかりでホント 人間不信になっちゃう
It's full of riffraff, honestly—makes you lose faith in humanity!

82
01:12:03,257 --> 01:12:12,257
気づいたの この世界に血も涙もない事 あれもダメ これもダメ それもダメ どれもダメ 現実は世知辛い
I realized there's no blood or tears in this world. This is no good, that's no good, that's no good, none of it is any good—reality is harsh.

83
01:12:18,257 --> 01:12:21,257
全部改変ですわ！
It's total alteration!

84
01:12:21,257 --> 01:12:27,257
あたし なんてったってお姫様 この人生におけるヒロイン
I am, when all is said and done, a princess—the heroine of this life!

85
01:12:27,257 --> 01:12:33,257
悲しいシナリオも 全部全部 書き換えちゃうの
I'll rewrite every single sad scenario completely!

86
01:12:33,257 --> 01:12:37,257
だってだって お姫様 自分の物語くらいは
Because, after all, a princess—at least for her own story—

87
01:12:37,257 --> 01:12:42,257
キっラキっラ楽しまなきゃ ですわ！ ですわ！ ですわ！
has got to enjoy it sparklingly! Desuwa! Desuwa! Desuwa!

88
01:12:43,257 --> 01:12:49,257
今にみてなさい！ 運命なんて 改変して差し上げますわ！
Just you wait and see! I'll alter your fate for you!

89
01:12:55,257 --> 01:13:00,257
だれ？だれ？だれ？だれ？だれ？ 裏で糸を引いてるのはだれ？
Who? Who? Who? Who? Who? Who is pulling the strings behind the scenes?

90
01:13:00,257 --> 01:13:04,257
操り人形だなんて ごめんだわ まったく
Being treated like a marionette? No thank you, not at all!

91
01:13:05,257 --> 01:13:12,257
上品な顔してても 黒幕はあの人かも まずはあたしが 強くならなきゃ 未来は変わらない
Even with a refined face, the mastermind might be that person. First, I have to become strong, or the future won't change!

92
01:13:13,257 --> 01:13:21,257
改革だ 改革だ 改革だ 自分改革ですわ！
Reform! Reform! Reform! Self-reform, desuwa!

93
01:13:21,257 --> 01:13:27,257
そうよ なんてったってお姫様 あたしこそ最高権力者
That's right, when all is said and done, a princess—I am the supreme authority!

94
01:13:27,257 --> 01:13:31,257
生涯のすべての主導権はこちらにあるわ
All the initiative for my entire life lies right here!

95
01:13:32,257 --> 01:13:36,257
だってだって お姫様 自分で決めたことくらいは
Because, after all, a princess—at least for things she decides herself—

96
01:13:37,257 --> 01:13:41,257
わがままに行かなきゃ ですわ！ ですわ！ ですわ！
has got to be selfish! Desuwa! Desuwa! Desuwa!

97
01:13:44,257 --> 01:13:50,257
女神！ 聖女！ 叡智！ 聡明！ 慈愛！ 博愛！ ですわ！
Goddess! Saint! Wisdom! Brilliance! Mercy! Universal love! Desuwa!

98
01:13:50,257 --> 01:13:55,257
ですわ みんな こぼ姫って言って！
That's right! Everyone, call me Princess Kobo!

99
01:13:58,257 --> 01:14:05,257
今日も軽くステップする 運命の歯車が踊り出す
Today too, stepping lightly, the gears of fate begin to dance.

100
01:14:05,257 --> 01:14:09,257
顔を上げたその時 ほら世界が恋する
When I raise my head, look—the world falls in love!

101
01:14:13,257 --> 01:14:17,257
あたし ハッピーエンドプリンセス この人生におけるヒロイン
I am the Happy End Princess, the heroine in this life!

102
01:14:19,257 --> 01:14:27,257
すったもんだある日々も 全部全部 愛してみせるの
I'll show you how I love every single turbulent day as well!

103
01:14:28,257 --> 01:14:33,257
ハッピーエンドプリンセス 自分の物語くらいは
Happy End Princess—at least for your own story,

104
01:14:34,257 --> 01:14:43,257
キラキラ楽しまなきゃ ですわ！ ですわ！ ですわ！ 全力で生き抜かなきゃ ですわ！ ですわ！ ですわ！
you've gotta enjoy it sparklingly! Desuwa! Desuwa! Desuwa! Gotta live through it with all your might! Desuwa! Desuwa! Desuwa!

105
01:14:44,257 --> 01:14:49,257
今にみてなさい！ 運命なんて 改変して差し上げますわ！
Just you wait and see! I'll alter fate for you!

106
01:14:55,257 --> 01:14:59,257
女神！ 聖女！ 叡智！ 聡明！ 慈愛！ 博愛！ ですわ！
Goddess! Saint! Wisdom! Brilliance! Mercy! Universal love! Desuwa!

107
01:15:17,456 --> 01:15:19,756
ハッピーギラファ～～～！！ ねねちのギラギラファンミーティングへようこそ！
Happy Giraffa! Welcome to Nenechi's dazzling fan meeting!

108
01:15:23,316 --> 01:15:26,056
さぁ！ツノと顎をなが～～～く伸ばして
Come on, stretch your horns and jaws way out long!

109
01:15:26,376 --> 01:15:28,836
おもいっきり、楽しんじゃおうね！
Let's enjoy it to the fullest!

110
01:15:28,836 --> 01:15:30,636
それじゃあ、いっくよ～～～！
Here we go!

111
01:15:32,716 --> 01:15:36,116
アミーヲ！カケーロ！ ビバ！ギラファ！
Amiw0! Kakero! Viva! Giraffa!

112
